Subject: [PATCH 037/119] feat: DOF 3.0 lens-model core - thin-lens signed CoC,
 shared pupil function with spherical-aberration apodization, energy-weighted
 scatter-as-gather with pupil-fraction near alpha, natively sharp composite;
 %_RT_SAMPLE2 permutation, stock path untouched

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
